  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext>M</mtext><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>adj</mtext><mfenced><mtext>adjM</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8756;&#160;adj&#160;M</mtext><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mtext>M</mtext><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>adj&#160;M&#160;</mtext><mtext>.&#160;adj&#160;</mtext><mfenced><mtext>adjM</mtext></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8658;adj&#160;M</mtext><mo>.</mo><msup><mtext>M</mtext><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtext>AdjM</mtext></mfenced><mtext>I</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8658;adj&#160;M</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtext>M</mtext></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext>M</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>By equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>adj&#160;M</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>M</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8658;M</mtext><mo>.</mo><mtext>adjM</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>M</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p>Now, by equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>adj&#160;M</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>M</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mtext>adj&#160;</mtext><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p>"
